e marked “Imprest, for incidental expenses”: ₹15,000. Every rupee will be accounted for. Let the state see how a philosopher spends.","time":"06:30","type":"file"},{"id":"2026-10-02:event:55bc9fa68e072dd4:1","kind":"event","name":"Mr. R. K. Malhotra","place":"lodhi","role":"retired from the Indian Administrative Service","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"55bc9fa68e072dd462f05de6ba700b124a8e3a74a40e149def5d4631cf8bfdb0"},"time":"07:45","type":"people"},{"gone":false,"id":"2026-10-02:event:8762e530e82c78f1:1","item":"Black frock coat, Berlin tailoring","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"entries","index":11,"sha256":"8762e530e82c78f193679be9bef2da46595406546dfeb921564bbd9efa11bd3d"},"status":"Retired. 31 °C at twenty to nine.","time":"08:40","type":"wear"},{"gone":false,"id":"2026-10-02:event:b32ac4b8902b413a:1","item":"Shirtsleeves and waistcoat","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"entries","index":12,"sha256":"b32ac4b8902b413aa96778dc1f022c072423b7877f7a2af1a8c93bfb7c49713c"},"status":"Worn from 08:40.","time":"08:40","type":"wear"},{"id":"2026-10-02:event:c18701865b4f09df:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"entries","index":15,"sha256":"c18701865b4f09df967f12eb75f372d4f257be4a15d7a3e63c3020af80b1abb8"},"text":"Today is Gandhi Jayanti, a national holiday. The Directorate of Estates is closed until Monday. The error in my favour stands for three days.","time":"10:45","type":"file"},{"amount":640,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":null,"direction":"out","id":"2026-10-02:payment:2474b1cae27d985a:1","item":"Fountain pen and a bound notebook","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"khan","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":18,"sha256":"2474b1cae27d985a39700f1e8b03d978bf373ddc9387e5ecc0709a91f974d3db"},"time":"12:55"},{"amount":1250,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":null,"direction":"out","id":"2026-10-02:payment:1fa3e767bd010c60:1","item":"White cotton kurta, ready-ma